 "text": "Pixy-led means led astray by a fairy. The fairy cast a glamour so the path seemed wrong. A traveler turned in circles and found no way out until the fairy lifted the spell. Remedies included iron, salt, or clothes worn backwards. These acts gave some hope against the charm.",
